-- PART II-B: 51-BIN ADAPTIVE ANTITONE `riemannPhi` MOMENTS, 2x EXPANDED
--            CRITICAL-STRIP CORRIDOR `(0, 1) × [-4, 4]`, AND `Ξ(γ) > 0` ON `[-7, 7]`
