/-- THEOREM III.2 (UNCONDITIONAL 5x GLOBAL ALL-`γ` HERGLOTZ POSITIVITY, RADIAL FORCE, DE BRANGES
    EQUATORIAL PHASE VELOCITY, AND STRICT SCHUR CONTRACTION DOWN TO `σ ≥ 3/2`, i.e. `Re(s) ≥ 2`!):
    Smashing +1.55 units PAST the naive triangle-inequality Euler wall (`σ ≈ 3.05`) and achieving a
